# Frequently Asked Questions

### What does Bootode IT Hub do?

Bootode IT Hub builds custom software, integrates AI into business workflows, digitizes business operations, and helps organizations deploy and manage technology platforms.

### What types of businesses do you work with?

We aim to serve businesses of different sizes, from small and growing businesses to larger organizations. Our solutions can be tailored to sectors such as education, healthcare, hospitality, pharmacy, retail, and other industries.

### Do you develop custom software?

Yes. We develop software based on your business requirements, operational processes, and project objectives.

### Can you integrate AI into my existing business?

Yes. We can assess your existing workflows and systems and identify appropriate ways to integrate AI, automate repetitive tasks, and improve how information is processed.

### Do I need to replace my current software to use your services?

Not necessarily. Where technically feasible, we can integrate with your existing systems, improve them, or recommend a migration if it better meets your needs.

### How does your pricing model work?

We offer activity-based pricing models in which fees are calculated using agreed units of business activity. For example, a school might be charged according to the number of students covered, while a hotel might be charged according to completed bookings or occupied room-nights.

The exact pricing unit depends on the solution and the client's industry.

### Do you charge a fixed monthly subscription?

Our business model is designed to reduce dependence on traditional fixed subscription fees by offering activity-based pricing where appropriate. Some projects may require implementation fees or separately agreed charges for infrastructure, third-party services, support, or other operating costs.

### What happens if my business has little or no activity?

Under an activity-based arrangement, charges linked to business activity can decrease when billable activity decreases. Whether any minimum, infrastructure, or other fees apply will be explained in your agreement.

### How much does it cost to develop software?

The cost depends on the project's complexity, functionality, integrations, security requirements, and ongoing operating needs. We discuss your requirements before proposing a suitable scope and pricing structure.

### How long does a software project take?

Timelines depend on the size and complexity of the project. After reviewing your requirements, we can propose a development plan and estimated delivery timeline.

### Do you provide support after deployment?

Support, maintenance, updates, and monitoring can be included in a separately agreed service arrangement based on your system and requirements.

### How do we get started?

Contact us with a brief description of your business, the challenge you want to solve, and your desired outcome. We will discuss your requirements and potential next steps.

### Can you work with clients outside Ghana?

We can discuss projects from clients in other markets, subject to project requirements, technical capabilities, and the appropriate commercial and regulatory arrangements.